    "text": "The total number of optically active compounds formed in the following reaction is:\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/65KiDUkcJ0VOWzShf9y6N-Dtf-AgBNRj2WqIXk2_Rck.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
