  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "The total number of optically active compounds formed is four. The product has two chiral $\\mathrm{C}$ atoms. Thus, it has $2^n=2^2=4$ stereoisomers.\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/yI0_hW6VCRISY_a3c8797k0KFpG4nx5TaKfMqWXoNSg.original.fullsize.png\"><br><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/8vn3tMc09WtKJaFnkDlyeCeTGrkDEoq-Q5xZ-tO-twM.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
